msgstr "Das alte Bild geht in das neue über"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Zufällig"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "One of the first four, at a random angle"
msgstr "Einer der ersten vier, in einem zufälligen Winkel"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keiner"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "GNOME changes the picture by itself"
msgstr "GNOME wechselt das Bild selbst"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Transition"
msgstr "Übergang"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
