msgstr "Eine abgerundete obere Leiste mit Abstand zum Bildschirmrand"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Hairline"
msgstr "Haarlinie"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "A thin, solid top bar, crisp corners and fine lines"
msgstr "Eine dünne, deckende obere Leiste, klare Ecken und feine Linien"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Capsule"
msgstr "Kapsel"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "The clock in a dark capsule, and everything else a pill"
msgstr "Die Uhr in einer dunklen Kapsel und alles andere als Pille"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Monospace, square and lined, like a terminal"
msgstr "Monospace, eckig und liniert, wie ein Terminal"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Segments"
msgstr "Segmente"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "The top bar in blocks of the theme's colours"
msgstr "Die obere Leiste in Blöcken aus den Farben des Themas"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Dark glass outlined and glowing in the theme's accent"
msgstr "Dunkles Glas, umrandet und leuchtend im Akzent des Themas"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stil"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The shape of the top bar, menus, notifications, dialogs, buttons and windows."
msgstr "Die Form von oberer Leiste, Menüs, Benachrichtigungen, Dialogen, Knöpfen und Fenstern."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Amethystora UI is not installed."
msgstr "Amethystora UI ist nicht installiert."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while Reduce transparency is on."
msgstr "Das Glas wird deckend gezeichnet, solange „Transparenz reduzieren“ eingeschaltet ist."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while High Contrast is on."
msgstr "Das Glas wird deckend gezeichnet, solange „Hoher Kontrast“ eingeschaltet ist."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The glass is drawn solid while the power saver is on."
msgstr "Das Glas wird deckend gezeichnet, solange der Energiesparmodus eingeschaltet ist."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Frost"
msgstr "Frost"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Thick, milky glass with an even tint"
msgstr "Dickes, milchiges Glas mit gleichmäßiger Tönung"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Prism"
msgstr "Prisma"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
msgid "Less tint, more colour, a lit top edge and light along the bottom"
msgstr "Weniger Tönung, mehr Farbe, eine beleuchtete Oberkante und Licht am unteren Rand"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/amethystora-ui@iarsslen.github.io/modules/pill/digest.js
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Klar"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list usr/share/amethystora/just/desktop.just
