msgstr "Was obere Leiste, Dock, Menüs und Benachrichtigungen vom Hintergrundbild hinter ihnen zeigen."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Comfort"
msgstr "Komfort"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "The power saver makes the glass solid for as long as it is on."
msgstr "Der Energiesparmodus macht das Glas deckend, solange er eingeschaltet ist."

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Reduce transparency"
msgstr "Transparenz reduzieren"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
