#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Banners"
msgstr "Banner"

#: usr/libexec/amethystora-control-list
msgid "Calls, alarms and urgent ones always come through. Held banners wait in the list."
msgstr "Anrufe, Wecker und dringende kommen immer durch. Zurückgehaltene Banner warten in der Liste."

